    364  f19e							; TitleIntro — intro-screen ($FD) edge check. Entered by JMP from DropStep
    365  f19e							; (no pending return; tail-jumps out — never rts, or it would pop a stale
    366  f19e							; frame return). Any SELECT/RESET press (level-triggered, prev-released via
    367  f19e							; StepsLeft): DropTarget=$FF (old title) + jsr DropArm (.DATitle pose/score
    368  f19e							; — the room is ALREADY loaded from boot LoadLevel, no deep LoadLevel:
    369  f19e							; stack depth DropStep→TitleIntro→DropArm keeps sim_bomb_fuse min-SP).
