    827  f584							; --- Respawn hover (user rule 2026-10-21) ------------------------------
    828  f584							; $FF = armed at death (kernel LoseLife): an untouched player keeps
    829  f584							; hovering. The FIRST direction/fire press starts the 1.5 s grace, which
    830  f584							; then expires on its own so a sideways-only player still falls. Frozen
    831  f584							; while a drop-in/title/tally owns the player (DropTarget != 0) — otherwise
    832  f584							; the grace expires before he lands and the water death repeats.
