    858  f5a7							; Line 1: Timer bar — PF body, mid-scanline COLUPF yellow→red
    859  f5a7							; Full (BarLevel >= BAR_MAX-7 = 113..120): pure yellow, no red write.
    860  f5a7							; The 8-dec hold (bugs.md #30, 2026-10-11) delays the FIRST red until
    861  f5a7							; t=8s = exactly one chunk period (K=8), so the first red appears on
