   1615  fa26							; body had no caller. Deleting it (plus the bank0 `sta` half and this bank's
   1616  fa26							; `jmp` half) reclaimed 15 B here and removed a live-but-uncalled pad.
   1617  fa26
   1618  fa26							; ClearPFColumn — A = left-half col 0..19; LineCount ($84) = first row;
   1619  fa26							;   CollisionEndY = last row (inclusive). AND-clear that col's
   1620  fa26							;   PF bit in those rows only. Clobbers A/X/Y + CPCScratch ($89) — NO
   1621  fa26							;   CollisionX (plan 5.1: BombMarkWalls keeps its broken-wall count there
   1622  fa26							;   across the call). Same-bank rts tail: BombMarkWalls jsrs this directly;
   1623  fa26							;   the old CallPad_ClearPFColumn path died with ApplyBombWalls (dead pad
   1624  fa26							;   kept).
   1625  fa26							;   Scratched retargeted Temp ($AD = bank0 TickCounter!) → $89 (plan 5.1b,
   1626  fa26							;   2026-10-20): every punch used to write the 60-frame game timer, and the
   1627  fa26							;   cell punch calls this up to 24×/blast instead of 2×, so the aliasing had
   1628  fa26							;   to go. $89 was RcBase; the rect cache has no reader since 5.1b.
   1629  fa26				   ClearPFColumn
